Note, though, that NetHack's usual strength function, acurrstr(), is
far from monotonic. The mapping used:

    3 - 18    : 3 - 18
18/01 - 18/31 : 19
18/32 - 18/81 : 20
18/82 - 18/** : 21
   19 - 21    : 21
   22 - 25    : 22 - 25

(There are occasionally different breakpoints, such as for combat
bonuses and tearing through webs. But having 19 strength is never,
AFAIK, worse than having 18/**.)

